// SLOW ENDPOINT: GET /api/dashboard - takes 3.2 seconds, genuinely
// too slow, investigated using this lesson's complete sequence

// STEP 1 - N+1 check: instrumented query counting reveals exactly
// 4 total queries, NOT scaling with any result set size - N+1 is
// RULED OUT as the cause; moving to step 2

